POWER BI MAP CONTEXT
  The Shape Map in powerbi/ draws the neighbouring counties round the tracts, with large water cut out: US Census Bureau,
  TIGERweb (Counties and Areal Hydrography), public domain, generalised and cut to the map frame. The ocean is the map
  background showing where no land is drawn.

NOT INCLUDED
  No patient-level data: every value is a weekly total per hospital as HHS published it. Nothing in this repository is
  derived from OpenStreetMap. No imagery was traced, and no Google, Nearmap, Esri or Mapbox imagery was used. Nothing
  here implies endorsement by HHS, the Census Bureau or any hospital.

